---
import './freshness.css';
---
<figure class="fresh-figure">
 <div class="figure-heading"><span class="figure-number">Figure 3</span>One change, two different answers</div>
 <div class="scene">
  <div class="box changed"><p class="label">Source · north’s P7</p><strong>GBP 20.00 → GBP 22.00</strong><span>Revision 1 → revision 2</span></div>
  <p class="label">Both cached answers depend on that price ↓</p>
  <div class="row">
   <div class="box"><strong>Product card</strong><span>Before: Blue mug · GBP 20.00</span><span>After: Blue mug · GBP 22.00</span><p class="callout">The displayed price changes.</p></div>
   <div class="box"><strong>Products below GBP 21.00</strong><span>Before: includes P7</span><span>After: excludes P7</span><p class="callout">The membership changes.</p></div>
  </div>
  <p>Deleting only the product card leaves P7 in the cached list.</p>
 </div>
 <figcaption>Two answers for shop north, en-GB and GBP. The list is a separate query result. Its dependency includes whether P7 satisfies the filter, even if it stores only product IDs.</figcaption>
</figure>
